# nauvis.surface: two small factories on the test map's real nauvis terrain (read 2026-10-20 by
# python -m fkcore read-terrain, tick 279590). On paper only: nauvis is read-only for this game,
# and its build script has no diff or apply.
#   iron:  iron-ore#2 (329 tiles, 876k) and the pond south-east of it; the plates cross to a
#          chest below the pond, so their belt and its pole chain must go round the water.
#   gears: the map's one cliff wall (x 181..182, y 270..288): plates from a requester chest on
#          its west side to a gear assembler on its east side.
surface  nauvis
mode     play
terrain  map                                    # map.terrain.json: -176,56 .. 216,288
catalog  base

place iron  = iron  plot -168,64 144x140 patch iron-ore#2
place gears = gears plot 160,256 48x32

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h
